kdown.HtmlBlockKind","kind":"inductive","line":292,"name":"Lean.Markdown.HtmlBlockKind","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Html.lean#L292-L314"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Html.html#Lean.Markdown.parseCompleteTagLine?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Markdown</span>.<span class=\"name\">parseCompleteTagLine?</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/String/Defs.html#String.Slice\">String.Slice</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">cur</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/Markdown/InlineCursor.html#Lean.Markdown.InlineCursor\">InlineCursor</a> <span class=\"fn\">s</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Parses a complete HTML open or closing tag after its `<` at `cur`, followed by nothing but spaces\nand tabs, which is the start condition of a complete-tag HTML block (CommonMark §4.6, start\ncondition 7). Returns the cursor at the end of the input.","docLink":"./Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Html.html#Lean.Markdown.parseCompleteTagLine?","kind":"def","line":276,"name":"Lean.Markdown.parseCompleteTagLine?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Data/Markdown/Parser/Html.lean#L276-L290"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"brea